# Prompt
* fakePathDotIsAbsolute
This function should detect if the folder is absolute both for windows and linux not regarding
in which OS it is executed (by string operations).
If the signature of the function in this prompt is wrong, feel free to fix it like in the
original path.isAbsolute function

Special cases that should be considered:
* Unix style path but with windows slash
\absolute\path\file.txt -> true